@WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5147

### Health
GET {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Register
POST {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@worklanex.local",
  "password": "DemoPass123",
  "fullName": "Demo User"
}

### Login
POST {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@worklanex.local",
  "password": "DemoPass123"
}

### Me (replace token after login)
GET {{WorkLaneX.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
